  "body": "Last Two to Be Launched.\r\n\r\nProperty Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CZ6P\r\n\r\n* 10 Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n* Quality Bosch Appliances.\r\n* Freehold, No Body Corp, Pets Allowed.\r\n* Both Are Standalone.\r\n* Ducted Heating, Insulation, Double Glazing.\r\n* Double Garage with Internal Access.\r\n* Gas and Electric Cooking.\r\n\r\n23B and 23C Carlisle Road showcase contemporary design, quality craftsmanship and thoughtful attention to detail, delivering the space, style and comfort today's buyers are looking for. Beautifully appointed and designed for modern living, these  residences offer a wonderful balance of generous interiors, effortless functionality and relaxed coastal appeal.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover light-filled living spaces, stylish kitchens, quality finishes and seamless connections to outdoor entertaining. Whether enjoying time with family, hosting friends or simply relaxing at home, these properties have been designed to make everyday living feel effortless.\r\n\r\nTWO HOMES. TWO EXCEPTIONAL OPPORTUNITIES.\r\n\r\n23C CARLISLE ROAD\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, 4 bathrooms (all ensuite) \r\n* Open plan dining/kitchen with quality finishes plus butler's pantry\r\n* Spacious living with balcony\r\n* Elevated master suite with walk-in wardrobe and fabulous ensuite\r\n* Separate downstairs teenagers' retreat with its own deck\r\n* Double internal-access garaging and laundry\r\n\r\n\r\n23B CARLISLE ROAD\r\n\r\nAnother beautifully finished standalone residence, offering the same commitment to contemporary design, quality and comfortable modern living. A wonderful opportunity to secure a brand-new home in this sought-after coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms (including 2 ensuite) with a study\r\n* Contemporary kitchen with quality finishes plus butler's Pantry - electric and gas hob\r\n* Spacious open-plan living/dining\r\n* Elevated master suite with walk-in wardrobe and fabulous ensuite\r\n* Beautiful sea views \r\n* Double internal-access garaging and separate laundry\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and here you can enjoy the very best of the Browns Bay lifestyle. Stroll to the beautiful beach, enjoy the village cafés and restaurants, browse the local shops or make the most of the excellent everyday amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nBrand-new quality, impressive design and a superb established setting makes these homes an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nHappy to Conjunct!",
